	'bd_p' => 'Ivo\'s bistro, opening week. The pass moved 1.4 m; nobody crosses behind the fryer.',
	'bk_b1' => 'Site visits take place on site in your kitchen from Monday to Thursday during the quiet gap between services: either 09:30–11:30 or 15:00–17:00. The visit takes two hours and costs €480 excluding VAT, with travel within 80 km of our Oldmere studio included. Dates usually open three weeks ahead. If you commission a full kitchen design up to 120 m² within three months, the full €480 fee is deducted from your design balance. To book a visit date, submit an inquiry or email hello@mise-studio.example. You can also call studio manager Mina Castell at +00 41 2207 5530 during studio hours, Monday to Friday from 08:30 to 17:30.',
	'bk_b2' => 'To make the most of our two hours on site, please have four key pieces of information ready for the design team. First, your expected cover count per service and turning times. Second, your current or proposed food menu, highlighting core cooking techniques such as plancha, frying, or baking. Third, an existing floor plan or measured building survey if one exists. Fourth, known locations of gas pipework, electrical distribution boards, incoming water supply, and floor drainage gullies. Having these details ready allows Renata Solberg to assess physical building opportunities immediately.',
