	'ct_a1' => 'Site visit dates open three weeks in advance. We schedule visits Monday through Thursday in dedicated two-hour windows between services, either 09:30–11:30 or 15:00–17:00. Because appointments fill quickly, we encourage contacting us as soon as you secure your premises or set a refurbishment timetable. If current dates are fully booked, Mina Castell can add your details to our visit waitlist for earlier openings.',
	'ct_a2' => 'Travel within 80 km of our Oldmere studio is included in our standard €480 site visit fee and full design packages. We regularly design commercial kitchens across the region. For sites located beyond 80 km, we are pleased to travel, billing only direct travel expenses at cost with no added administrative charges. We confirm all travel costs in writing before confirming your visit.',
	'ct_a3' => 'We schedule site visits strictly between 09:30–11:30 and 15:00–17:00 so that your kitchen can be evaluated without interrupting active food service. During these quiet hours between breakfast, lunch, and dinner, the head chef and line cooks can speak freely with Renata Solberg, walk the cooking line, and discuss real prep routes while equipment is idle and safe to inspect.',
	'ct_a4' => 'When contacting our studio, it is helpful to provide your kitchen type, premises location, anticipated covers per service, and project schedule. If you have an existing architectural floor plan or preliminary equipment ideas, please share them with us. If you are starting with an empty shell or planning a full strip-out, an initial site visit is all that is required to evaluate the space and establish your written brief.',
	'ct_a5' => 'Studio manager Mina Castell monitors studio correspondence continuously throughout the day and replies to every contact form message and email within one working day. If your inquiry involves an imminent contractor tender deadline, immediate equipment purchase, or an urgent site lease decision, calling our studio directly at +00 41 2207 5530 during weekday studio hours is the fastest way to speak with us and confirm diary availability.',
