	'fe2_a1' => 'Travel within 80 km of our studio at Unit 4, Ferrier Yard, 22 Canal Street, Oldmere is included in all quoted fees. For commercial kitchens located beyond 80 km, we never charge inflated management rates; we simply invoice travel at direct cost for fuel or standard train travel. All travel expenses and travel times are agreed with you in writing before your site visit or floor test is confirmed in the diary.',
	'fe2_a2' => 'All fees listed in our schedule exclude value added tax. VAT is applied at the statutory rate on each invoice. Every invoice issued by Mise Studio provides a clear breakdown of net professional fees, applicable VAT, and payment due dates, structured for straightforward business expense reporting and your contractor accounting records. Invoices are delivered electronically to your accounting contact upon reaching each agreed project milestone.',
	'fe2_a3' => 'Our room layout drawings include two complete revisions as standard. Kitchen designers Kwame Asante and Leonor Vidal work closely with you during Weeks 2 and 3 to adjust bench dimensions, pass positions, and equipment choices based on your operational review. If your operational concept or menu changes fundamentally after two revisions have been completed, additional drawing work can be quoted before proceeding to the floor-tape test.',
	'fe2_a4' => 'The initial €480 fee paid for your site visit and written brief is credited back in full if you proceed with us. When you commission a full kitchen design up to 120 m² within three months of your site visit date, €480 is deducted directly from your initial design invoice balance. This ensures that exploring your project brief and testing operational routes carries no financial penalty.',
	'fe2_a5' => 'You may cancel or reschedule a site visit free of charge up to 48 hours before the agreed appointment time. Please notify studio manager Mina Castell by telephone or email as soon as your schedule changes. Cancellations made with less than 48 hours notice may forfeit the visit fee, as our scheduled travel window and reserved diary slot cannot be reassigned to the visit waitlist on short notice.',
