	'tagline' => 'Commercial kitchen design · since 2014',
	'th_b1' => 'Thank you for writing to Mise Studio. Studio manager Mina Castell will review your kitchen details and reply within one working day. Our studio is open Monday to Friday from 08:30 to 17:30. If your request involves an urgent tender deadline, immediate equipment purchase, or pending building lease, you can also telephone us directly at +00 41 2207 5530 or write to hello@mise-studio.example. We look forward to discussing your kitchen brief and confirming your site visit window.',
