	'th_intro' => 'Thank you for contacting Mise Studio. Studio manager Mina Castell will review your inquiry and reply within one working day.',
	'th_rsh' => 'Five weeks, in order',
	'tm_b1' => 'All design fees quoted by Mise Studio exclude VAT, which is charged at the prevailing statutory rate on all invoices. Travel within 80 km of our studio at Unit 4, Ferrier Yard, 22 Canal Street, Oldmere is included in quoted prices; travel beyond 80 km is invoiced at direct cost. For full kitchen design packages up to 120 m² at €7,800, payment terms are 30% upon commission, with the remaining balance payable upon completion and hand-over of drawings, equipment schedules, and services plans. If a full kitchen design is commissioned within three months of your initial site visit, the €480 site visit fee is deducted entirely from the total design fee.',
	'tm_b2' => 'Room layout drawings include two complete rounds of revisions to accommodate brigade feedback and contractor adjustments. Major structural changes requested after the second revision has been signed off may incur additional design fees, agreed in writing before work begins. Site visits may be cancelled or rescheduled free of charge up to 48 hours prior to the booked appointment; visits cancelled with less than 48 hours notice may forfeit the visit fee. Hand-over is complete when final layout drawings, equipment schedules, and services plans are issued to your contractor. Mise Studio accepts no liability for contractor installation errors or site alterations made without our written approval.',
