	'vs_windows' => 'Visit windows 09:30–11:30 or 15:00–17:00',
	'wl2_b1' => 'Site visit dates for commercial kitchen briefs open three weeks ahead and are conducted Monday to Thursday between services, from 09:30–11:30 or 15:00–17:00. Because our visit calendar fills rapidly, earlier appointments occasionally open when an active client\'s building schedule shifts or contractor dates are adjusted. Joining the visit waitlist gives your restaurant or catering business immediate priority when an earlier two-hour slot frees up within our 80 km travel radius, helping you advance your project without waiting for next month\'s calendar release.',
	'wl2_b2' => 'By submitting your email address for the visit waitlist, you will receive a direct notification only when an earlier site visit window opens unexpectedly, plus a short notice when the following month\'s visit dates are published. We send nothing else: no marketing newsletters, no advertising campaigns, and no unsolicited emails. You can remove yourself from the waitlist at any time by replying to our email, and we never share your contact details with external third parties.',
	'wl2_cap1' => 'One email when a slot frees up',
